// @vibe/cache — content-addressed persistent build/artifact cache path
// derivation + fingerprinting, and the module-header text codec (ADR-0070
// Phase 3, #897). No opaque/transparent types: every declared name is a
// pure fn over String/Bytes/Array/tuple primitives, never a struct/enum.
// `version` was `export let version = "0.0.1"` directly in the old
// index.vibe facade -- a real importable binding, not just contract
// metadata -- so it is preserved verbatim as an implementation-file value
// (cache.vibe) with a matching bodyless declaration here (Codex review
// precedent, PR #914).

